OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BMcCague 'understands' St Eunan's anger 
OL,5,Bamid score controversy                 
OL,6,GScotstown manager David McCague says   
OL,7,Ghe "understands" why St Eunan's have   
OL,8,Glodged a formal objection after the    
OL,9,Gdecision to award his side's late      
OL,10,Gextra-time equaliser in their Ulster   
OL,11,GClub SFC semi-final win at Brewster    
OL,12,GPark on Saturday.                      
OL,14,FTrailing by one with just seconds      
OL,15,Fremaining in extra time, holders       
OL,16,FScotstown were awarded a free which    
OL,17,Fwas taken by Kieran Hughes. Replays    
OL,18,Fsuggest the ball tailed wide and while 
OL,19,Fthe umpires did not indicate a point   
OL,20,For a wide, referee Kieran Eannetta     
OL,21,Fawarded the score which sent the game  
OL,22,Fto penalties.                     G1/4 
