OL,4,BCiting hearing was 'extra stress' for  
OL,5,BPrendergast                            
OL,6,GIreland's Sam Prendergast has said     
OL,7,Ghead coach Andy Farrell was            
OL,8,G"unbelievably supportive" while the    
OL,9,Gfly-half waited to find out whether he 
OL,10,Gwould be available to face South       
OL,11,GAfrica last weekend.                   
OL,13,FThe Leinster playmaker had a citing    
OL,14,Fcomplaint against him dismissed before 
OL,15,Fstarting in the 20-17 victory over the 
OL,16,Fback-to-back world champions, but the  
OL,17,Falleged hip-drop tackle was brought up 
OL,18,Fin media conferences by Springbok      
OL,19,Fcoaches Rassie Erasmus and Mzwandile   
OL,20,FStick.                                 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
