OL,4,BSri Lanka beat Ireland in Emerging     
OL,5,BNations final                          
OL,6,GICC Women's Emerging Nations Trophy    
OL,7,Gfinal, Ajman                           
OL,9,FSri Lanka 99-4 (12.4 overs): Dulani    
OL,10,F44*, Kavindi 25; McCartney 2-16        
OL,12,FIreland 96 all out (19.3 overs):       
OL,13,FDalzell 24, Little 15; Sandeepani 4-13 
OL,15,FSri Lanka win by six wickets           
OL,17,FScorecard                              
OL,19,FIreland Women suffered a disappointing 
OL,20,Fdefeat in the final of the Emerging    
OL,21,FNations Trophy as they fell to a six-  
OL,22,Fwicket loss against Sri Lanka in AG3/4 
