OL,4,BLarne beat Glens to reach BetMcLean    
OL,5,BCup quarter-finals                     
OL,6,GLarne moved into the quarter-finals of 
OL,7,Gthe BetMcLean Cup as they triumphed 3- 
OL,8,G2 against Glentoran at the Oval.       
OL,10,FHolders Linfield also booked their     
OL,11,Fplace in the next round with a narrow  
OL,12,F1-0 victory over Championship side H&W 
OL,13,FWelders at the Blanchflower Stadium.   
OL,15,FAdam Brooks scored a hat-trick as      
OL,16,FColeraine thrashed Dungannon Swifts 5- 
OL,17,F1 at Stangmore Park while Ballymena    
OL,18,FUnited, Cliftonville and Limavady      
OL,19,FUnited also progressed.                
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
